  "title": "Nutty Bitter Ukrainian Bottarga Pilaf",
  "description": "A kid-friendly Ukrainian dish featuring bottarga and bonito shave, this pilaf is both bitter and aerated, making it a unique and exciting meal option. It is also ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly, making it a great choice for those following this diet.",
