  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the grated carrots and chopped celery and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked brown rice, chopped walnuts, dried and grated bottarga, and dried and shaved bonito shave to the skillet.",
    "Stir everything together and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the pilaf to a serving dish and serve hot.",
    "Garnish with additional chopped walnuts and bonito shave if desired."
